{"p":"Shanghai Maizhihua Sealing Element Co., Ltd.는 전신인 Shanghai Pingye Sealing Element Co., Ltd.를 바탕으로 1998년 2월에 설립되었습니다. 저희는 충전기 산업 체인 내 O링/이형 부품/고무 제품의 생산, 개발 및 판매를 전문으로 합니다. 소재는 EPDM/VMQ/FKM/FVMQ/HNBR/NBR 등이 있습니다.","pc":"上海麦之华密封件有限公司，前身是上海平叶密封件有限公司，于1998年2月成立。我们专业从事于充电桩产业链中的0型圈/异形件/橡胶制品的生产、开发与销售。材质有EDPM/VMQ/FKM/FVMQ/HNBR/NBR等。","pe":"","t":"O링/이형 부품/고무 제품","tc":"0型圈/异形件/橡胶制品","k":["신형 전력","에너지 저장","충전"],"w":"www.mzhseal.com","tel":"021-37525979","m":"hanyp@mzhseal.com","a":"上海奉贤庄行工业园区长庭路18号3号厂房","ae":"Factory 3, No.18 Changting Road, Fengxian Zhuangxing Industrial Park, Shanghai","img":"https://guanzhongxitong.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/20261015/1792035715306_1080*749.jpg","logo":"https://guanzhongxitong.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/20261015/1792035167273_1000*446.png","pr":[[57248,"충전기용 실링 링","充电桩系列密封圈","C","물과 먼지 밀봉  난연","密封水和灰尘  阻燃",["https://guanzhongxitong.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/20261015/1792043248416_1279*1706.jpg","https://guanzhongxitong.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/20261015/1792043254666_1279*1706.jpg","https://guanzhongxitong.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/20261015/1792043263511_810*1080.jpg"]],[57245,"충전기용 실링 시리즈","充电桩密封系列","A","물과 먼지 밀봉","密封水和灰尘",["https://guanzhongxitong.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/20261015/1792043063493_1279*1706.jpg","https://guanzhongxitong.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/20261015/1792043473406_1279*1706.jpg","https://guanzhongxitong.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/20261015/1792043489266_1279*1706.jpg"]],[57250,"충전기용 실링 링","充电桩系列密封圈","E","물과 먼지 밀봉","密封水和灰尘",["https://guanzhongxitong.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/20261015/1792043404505_1279*1706.jpg","https://guanzhongxitong.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/20261015/1792043410017_1279*1706.jpg","https://guanzhongxitong.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/20261015/1792043419035_1279*1706.jpg"]],[57251,"충전기용 실링 링","充电桩系列密封圈","F","물과 먼지 밀봉 난연","密封水和灰尘 阻燃",["https://guanzhongxitong.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/20261015/1792043539281_1279*1706.jpg","https://guanzhongxitong.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/2026101